{"at":"2026-10-04T16:42:41.535Z","toolCall":{"args":{"Arguments":{"applicability":"证明 IndexedDB 规范中合法的 key 类型仅支持 number, date, string, binary, array，boolean 不是合法的索引键类型，因此 isPinned 与 isFavorite 不能直接声明为索引或使用 where().equals(true)。","content":"W3C Indexed Database API 3.0 规范第 2.4 节明确规定：A key has an associated type which is one of: number, date, string, binary, or array. The following ECMAScript types are valid keys: Number primitive values, except NaN; Date objects; String primitive values; ArrayBuffer objects; Array objects. Attempting to convert other ECMAScript values to a key will fail. Boolean 类型并非有效 key，不能直接建索引。","hash":"c3a5c1e003fc2f7fa8d27ea2dc6b2e2e097b49aa81d8b138543c8725004e8536","kind":"official-source","location":"https://www.w3.org/TR/IndexedDB/","source":"https://www.w3.org/TR/IndexedDB/"},"ServerName":"project_architect","ToolName":"evidence_record","toolAction":"Recording official evidence for IndexedDB key types","toolSummary":"Record key types evidence"},"name":"call_mcp_tool"},"decision":"allow","stepIdx":20,"imagePath":null}
