{"at":"2026-10-04T16:43:35.806Z","toolCall":{"args":{"Arguments":{"applicability":"证明 JavaScript 模块（ESM，type=\\\"module\\\"）无法直接在浏览器通过 file:// 协议免服务器运行，会触发 CORS 跨域安全错误，必须通过本地 HTTP 服务器（如 npm run preview、npx serve）或 Web 服务器运行。","content":"MDN 官方文档明确指出：You need to pay attention to local testing — if you try to load the HTML file locally (i.e., with a file:// URL), you'll run into CORS errors due to JavaScript module security requirements. You need to do your testing through a server. 因此 Vite 构建出的 ESM 产物必须通过本地 HTTP/HTTPS 服务器提供服务，base: './' 不能用于绕过浏览器安全限制通过 file:// 直接双击运行。","hash":"deb285e95e1dca43e123ad6ef9f8eab6dd7bf2a022f373e5cfc37f24d88694e9","kind":"official-source","location":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Guide/Modules","scope":"technical","source":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Guide/Modules"},"ServerName":"project_architect","ToolName":"evidence_record","toolAction":"Recording official evidence for ESM file protocol limitations","toolSummary":"Record ESM file CORS evidence"},"name":"call_mcp_tool"},"decision":"allow","stepIdx":48,"imagePath":null}
